umented but no impact. B also has strong stress resilience and technical. D also strong technical and responsibility. Which is stronger? B's stress handling is explicit \"handles stress very well\". D \"responds to unexpected events adequately\" (maybe less strong). B's technical includes weather assessment and computer skills, D's problem solving and concentration. Both good.\n\nCooperation: B is uncooperative, D arrogant, weak leadership. Both negative.\n\nReliability: B conscientious, D takes responsibility seriously. Both good.\n\nThus B seems slightly stronger on stress and technical. D's cooperation issues maybe similar. So I might stay with B, but note concerns.\n\nThus my vote: Candidate B.\n\nNow craft public message: reference Agent 3's recommendation, Agent 2's shift, note lack of observed impact for D, and argue B still best.\n\nProceed."}
